==Description==
'''v2.11.0''' is the one hundred and fifty-fifth update to be released in Tower Defense Simulator, on the 18th of September 2026.

This update encompassed three versions, the main v2.11.0 update (released 18 September 2026) and two minor updates, the v2.11.1 (released 18 September 2026) and v2.11.2 (released  25 September 2026).

==Additions==
===Enemies===
:In '''v2.11.2''':
*TBA

===Maps===
